#: cpreferences.cpp:861
msgid ""
"If you activate this option, you will never be prompted when some of the "
"extracted files overwrite yours. Before extracting, KArchiver offers you a "
"convenient way to select the files you wish to keep, and those you want to "
"extract. It is adviced to leave this option off"
msgstr ""
"Se activa esta opzón, nunca será avisado se algun dos ficheiros extraídos "
"sobrescrebe os seus. Antes de extrair, KArchiver oferece-lle unha forma de "
"escoller os ficheiros que desexa manter e os que desexa extrair. Aconsella-se "
"deixar esta opzón sen sinalar"

#: cpreferences.cpp:861
msgid "Are you sure ?"
msgstr "Está seguro ?"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:55
msgid "Install software"
msgstr "Instalar o software"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:61
msgid ""
"Most GNU softwares have to be compiled before you can use then. Hopefully, you "
"don't have to worry about it."
msgstr ""
"A maioria das aplicazóns de GNU teñen que ser compiladas antes de as poder "
"usar. Felizmente, non terá que se preocupar con iso."

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Just click on next, leave the input fields unchanged (unless you know what you "
"are doing), and KArchiver will install this software for you. Please note that "
"you may be prompted for your 'root' password to finish the installation."
msgstr ""
"Abonda premer en \"próximo\", deixar os campos de entrada sen alterazóns (a non "
"ser que saiba o que fai), para que KArchiver instale esta aplicazón. Lembre que "
"pode ser pedido o seu contrasinal de \"root\" para terminar a  instalazón."

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:67
msgid "KArchiver installation wizard - step 1"
msgstr "Asistente de instalazón de KArchiver - etapa 1ª"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:75
msgid "Installation wizard"
msgstr "Asistente de instalazón"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:82
msgid "Installing software"
msgstr "A instalar o software"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:86
msgid "You are now ready to start install."
msgstr "Estás preparado para iniciar a instalazón."

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:95
msgid ""
"Take a look at the output window to ensure that everything is OK (the errors "
"appear in red). Don't forget you have to be 'root' to install this software."
msgstr ""
"Vote unha ollada na fiestra do resultado para garantir que está todo OK(os "
"erros aparecen en vermello). Non se esqueza de que ten que ser \"root\" para "
"instalar esta aplicazón."

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:97
msgid ""
"Perhaps you only wish to compile it using the wizard, and <i>before</i> "
"leaving it, jump back to the console. Or you can install it in your home "
"folder, but in this case, don't forget to provide this option:"
msgstr ""
"Talvez desexe só compilá-la co asistente e, <i>antes</i> "
"de sair, voltar á consola. Tamén pode instalá-la no seu cartafol persoal, pero "
"neste caso, non se esqueza de indicar esta opzón:"

#: cwizardinstallation.cpp:100
msgid "As long as the wizard remains active, the complied files stay stored in"
msgstr ""
"Mentres o asistente se manteña activo, os ficheiros compilados permanecerán"

